                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">1.Body Shaping Clinic
                                </b><br>
                                Slimming involves general weight reduction, while shaping targets fat reduction in
                                specific areas. Fat cells in the body remain constant in number but change size with
                                weight gain or loss. Destruction of fat cells results in permanent fat loss in that
                                area. Surgical fat cell destruction is achieved through liposuction, while non-surgical
                                methods include cryolipolysis, ultrasound cavitation, injection lipolysis, and body
                                tightening using radio frequency or HIFU. Liposuction simultaneously achieves fat loss
                                and collagen tightening, while treatments like cryolipolysis focus solely on fat cell
                                destruction, with skin tightening procedures adding additional benefits. These methods
                                offer permanent fat reduction solutions.<br>


                            </p>
                            
                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/cryolipolicys.png" alt="Cryolipolysis body contouring treatment" loading="lazy">

                            </div>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">2. Cryolipolysis

                                </b><br>
                                Cryolipolysis is a non-surgical fat reduction treatment that targets localized fat by
                                cooling the treated areas to nearly -4°C, leading to fat cell destruction and body
                                contouring. This FDA-approved method provides a safe and effective way to reduce fat
                                without surgery. It offers permanent fat reduction results in the treated areas. The
                                process is highly regarded for its non-invasive nature and effectiveness in contouring
                                the body. As a confidence-boosting treatment, Cryolipolysis ensures minimal risk while
                                achieving long-lasting results, making it a preferred choice for individuals seeking
                                body shaping and fat reduction.<br>


                            </p>
                            
                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/injection.png" alt="Injection lipolysis for localized fat reduction" loading="lazy">

                            </div>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">3. Injection lipolysis


                                </b><br>
                                SkinCity was one of the pioneers in practicing Injection Lipolysis, now standardized as
                                Lipodissolve with US FDA approval. This safe and effective treatment targets localized
                                fat reduction and works well in combination with Cavitation, Ultrasound, or
                                Cryolipolysis for enhanced results in body contouring and fat reduction.<br>


                            </p>
                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/laser lypolysis.png" alt="Laser lipolysis body treatment" loading="lazy">

                            </div>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">4. Skin City Laser
                                    Lipolysis


                                </b><br>
                                Cavitation Ultrasound combined with Cosmedico Radio Frequency is a globally accepted,
                                non-surgical body shaping protocol. It’s designed for individuals with localized fat
                                deposits, near-normal BMI, and controlled weight. This advanced treatment, consisting of
                                6 to 10 sessions spaced 15 days apart, delivers lipolysis and skin firming without
                                surgery. SkinCity pioneered the Ultrasound RF combination in India and offers this safe
                                alternative for those ineligible for liposuction procedures.<br>
                                Radio Frequency Body Shaping uses monopolar, unipolar, and bipolar devices to target
                                water molecules in the collagen layers, promoting skin and tissue tightening. Sessions,
                                typically 6-8 weeks, are effective for body shaping.<br>
                                Body HIFU (High-Intensity Focused Ultrasound) targets deeper collagen layers (1.5-4.5
                                mm), providing three-dimensional tissue tightening. This treatment is optimal when
                                combined with fat cell destruction therapies, ensuring long-lasting results. Four to six
                                fortnightly treatments are recommended for the best outcomes in body firming and
                                contouring.
                            </p>
                            

                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/fat transfer.png" alt="Fat transfer treatment" loading="lazy">

                            </div>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">5. Fat Transfer


                                </b><br>
                                Autologous fat is a natural and cost-effective filler used to enhance body contours. Fat
                                is harvested from unwanted areas and injected into regions like scars or hollow cheeks.
                                Since it’s the patient’s own fat, there’s no risk of allergic reactions or side effects,
                                making it a safe procedure.
                            </p>
                            
                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/liposuction.png" alt="Abdominal areas marked for liposuction" loading="lazy">

                            </div>
                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">6. Liposuction


                                </b><br>
                                <b style="color: #213360;font-size: 20px;text-align: justify;">It is the ‘GOLD STANDARD’
                                    procedure for permanent removal of skin fat</b><br>
                                <b>Q: What is liposuction?</b><br>

                                A: Liposuction is a minimally invasive procedure for the removal of stubborn fat
                                resistant to diet and exercise. It is done by using small cannualas to give a slimmer
                                contour to the body and face.<br>

                                <b>Q: What are the indications for liposuction?</b><br>

                                A: Liposuction can be performed on anyone above 18 years of age.

                                It works best for stubborn localised fat deposits which are resistant to diet and
                                exercise from areas like the tummy, love handles (flanks), buttocks, thighs, double chin
                                and jowls<br>

                                <b>Q: What is the difference between Safe Liposuction an unsafe liposuction?</b><br>

                                A: Safe Liposuction is performed in a fully awake patient under tumescent local
                                anesthesia without any sedation. Unsafe Liposuction is performed under general
                                anesthesia, regional anesthesia or heavy sedation and combined with multiple surgeries
                                when multiple body areas are treated together. Most liposuction complications and deaths
                                are attributed to such unsafe practices and complications arising out of
                                Anaesthesia.<br>

                                <b>Q: What is the unique SafeLIPO protocol practiced by SkinCity?
                                </b><br>
                                A: Skin City SafeLIPO Is a unique protocol combining safe tumescent liposuction, laser
                                liposuction, ultra sound lipolysis and radio frequency skin firming. This ensures
                                guaranteed safety, permanent fat cell destruction, smooth silky skin texture and
                                unbelievable post liposuction skin firming. The patient walks into Skin City at 10 am
                                and walks out at 4 pm after undergoing ‘SafeLIPO’. The patient does not even need
                                painkillers after the procedure. One can treat the entire body in multiple sessions, 1
                                to 2 body parts are covered in each session. A conscious patient who can stand and is
                                ambulatory, affords excellent precision to balanced fat removal. In selected patients
                                Skin City uses this unique concept of ‘Orthostatic SafeLIPO’ which is performed with
                                fine cannulas, while the patient is in an upright o standing position. The utmost
                                precision attained in the shaping and the complete assurance of safety in Orthostatic
                                SafeLIPO is commendable.

                                SkinCity’s dermatologists are trained in liposuction by various international experts
                                and is affiliated to ASDS, DASIL, ACSI, etc.<br>

                                <b>Q: What is Laser SafeLIPO?</b><br>

                                A: The addition of the latest 1470nm optical fiber laser has made SafeLIPO even more
                                safe and quick. It allows more fat removal besides giving amazing post procedure skin
                                tightening.<br>

                                <b>Q: When can I join work post procedure?</b><br>

                                A: You can join work the next day.<br>

                                <b>Q: What is the post operative advice?
                                </b><br>
                                A: Withhold strenuous activities for a week and wear pressure garments for 3-6
                                months.<br>

                                <b>Q: What happens to the excess skin?
                                </b><br>
                                A: Skin by virtue of its elasticity undergoes contracture and adheres to underlying
                                musculature. Liposuction can be complemented with non surgical skin tightening
                                procedures e.g Radiofrequency.<br>

                                <b>Q: Will I have any scars?</b><br>

                                A: Small incisions of 3-5 mm size will be made, but the scars are usually hidden in the
                                skin creases and will fade eventually and become undetectable.


                            </p>
                            

                            <div class="video-banner-layout3 bg-overlay mb-50" style="text-align: justify;">
                                <img src="assets/images/services/gym.png" alt="Gynecomastia treatment for men" loading="lazy">

