                            <p class="text-block__desc mb-20"><b
                                    style="color: #213360;font-size: 25px;text-align: justify;">7. Gynecomastia


                                </b><br>
                                Gynecomastia, or male breast enlargement, can be an embarrassing condition. It can occur
                                due to the growth of breast tissue (true gynecomastia) or the accumulation of fat and
                                fibrous tissue (pseudo gynecomastia). Traditionally, surgical removal of breast tissue
                                was used, but modern techniques like fine cannula liposuction and 1470 laser fiber offer
                                a non-invasive solution. SkinCity specializes in treating large gynecomastia without the
                                need for excision surgery. This bloodless, stitch-less procedure provides effective
                                results with minimal downtime, allowing patients to walk out in a few hours, making it a
                                preferred choice for many.
                            </p>
                            



